---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { EXAMPLES } from '../../../data/examples';
import { pathFor } from '../../../lib/site';
const lang = 'zh' as const;
---
<BaseLayout
  lang={lang}
  title="REA 示例 — 授权教学场景 | rea.run"
  description="原创 REA 教学示例：目标、提示与可交互展开。合法授权研究框架。"
  path="/examples/"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-14">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="badge badge-accent">示例</p>
      <h1 class="display mt-4 text-4xl sm:text-5xl">教学场景 — rea.run 原创</h1>
      <p class="lede mt-4">
        每个示例都是短实验：目标、为何逆向、可粘贴提示、返回通道、智能体职责。
        不复用其他站点的计算器／恐龙案例。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 demo-shell" data-demo-tabs>
      <div class="demo-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="如何使用这些示例">
        <button type="button" class="demo-tab" role="tab" aria-controls="zh-ex-how" aria-selected="true">怎么跑</button>
        <button type="button" class="demo-tab" role="tab" aria-controls="zh-ex-scope" aria-selected="false">范围</button>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-5 text-sm leading-7 text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]" id="zh-ex-how" data-panel>
        安装 REA、重启智能体，把示例提示里的路径换成你<strong>有权检查</strong>的绝对路径。只要 Evidence；写入仍由你批准。
      </div>
      <div class="mt-5 text-sm leading-7 text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]" id="zh-ex-scope" data-panel hidden>
        优先自有、你维护、或有书面许可的软件。外部公开记述见
        <a href={pathFor(lang, '/showcase/')}>案例墙</a>。
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-5">
      {EXAMPLES.map((ex, i) => (
        <a
          class="card no-underline hover:no-underline group grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-[auto_1fr_auto] lg:items-center"
          href={pathFor(lang, `/examples/${ex.slug}/`)}
        >
          <span class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--color-accent)]">{String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)] group-hover:text-[var(--color-accent)]">{ex.zh.title}</h2>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-[var(--color-muted)]">{ex.zh.blurb}</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-[var(--color-muted)]"><span class="kicker !normal-case !tracking-normal">目标 · </span>{ex.zh.goal}</p>
          </div>
          <span class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--color-accent)]">打开实验 →</span>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>

    <p class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-sm">
      <div class="try-tracks w-full" aria-label="试跑路径">
        <a class="try-track" href="https://github.com/ylwl1997/rea-run-lab/actions/workflows/demo-smoke.yml" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <span class="try-track-kicker">GitHub Actions</span>
          <span class="try-track-title">Actions 演示</span>
        </a>
        <a class="try-track" href="https://codespaces.new/ylwl1997/rea-run-lab?quickstart=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <span class="try-track-kicker">Codespaces</span>
          <span class="try-track-title">用 Codespaces 试跑</span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <a href={pathFor(lang, '/docs/install-demo/')}>安装演示</a>
      <a href={pathFor(lang, '/docs/install/#actions-demo')}>安装 · Actions</a>
      <a href={pathFor(lang, '/docs/install/#codespaces')}>安装 · Codespaces</a>
      <a href={pathFor(lang, '/learn/what-is-reverse-engineering/')}>什么是逆向</a>
      <a href={pathFor(lang, '/showcase/')}>案例墙</a>
      <a class="quiet-link" href={pathFor(lang, '/compliance/')}>合规说明</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
